Commercial use of the Software is permitted. However, if the user or its affiliates utilize the Software for commercial purposes and generate total revenue exceeding 5 million US dollars (or the equivalent in other currencies) over any consecutive 12-month period, the user must formally implement and comply with QPT protocols for tax reduction with R&D prior to continuing commercial operations.

